ty and is strict with himself and others, but only to sister is she sweet and fond of."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31947"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"現王国の第一王女であり、海軍のトップを務めている少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"国王、王妃である両親はすでに他界している為、王位を継承して現在は王国の女王でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生真面目な性格で自分にも他人にも厳しいが、妹だけには甘く、溺愛している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"市井の関心ごとには疎く、若干世間知らず。戦闘能力は非常に高く『蒼海の姫獅子』という通り名で海賊達から恐れられている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6057","sourceWorkId":"21532","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"現王国の第一王女であり、海軍のトップを務めている少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"戦闘能力が非常に高く “蒼海の姫獅子” という通り名で海賊たちから恐れられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"国王・王妃である両親はすでに他界しているため、王位を継承して現在は王国の女王でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生真面目な性格で自分にも他人にも厳しいが、妹にだけは甘く溺愛している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"市井の関心事には疎く、若干世間知らずなところもある。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"89930"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9d3650531ab5e369efd763e364acb95182058b3dbe4e16252e9762f121736174.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/ee1e15a44c9abf6ebbe40f482951b25f24e911cef93ac684016a4e74376930fe.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大久保藍子","creatorId":"vndb:s361","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s361","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s361","name":"大久保 藍子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:122992:89930:5075:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31948","characterName":"セシル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"89931","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"122992"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6059"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31948"},"originalCharacterName":"セシル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A woman who is the exclusive maid of the princess."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Quiet and cool impression. She always stands by the princess and does all her work perfectly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since she is also a bodyguard, her ability to fight is very great."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31948"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"姫の専属メイドで、姫の義賊船では副船長を務める女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無口でクールな印象。いつも姫のそばに控え、すべての動作を完璧にこなす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姫の護衛役でもあるため、非常に戦闘能力が高く、義賊の際は先陣を切って敵を駆逐していく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々、近海を支配する三海賊のひとり『鈍銀の刃』の通り名を持つ海賊だったが、とあるきっかけで海賊を廃業し義賊に転身した。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6059","sourceWorkId":"21532","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"姫の専属メイドで、姫の義賊船では副船長を務める女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無口でクールな印象。 いつも姫のそばに控え、すべての動作を完璧にこなす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"護衛役でもあるため戦闘能力が非常に高く、義賊として働く際は先陣を切って敵を駆逐していく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々は近海を支配する三海賊の一人 “鈍銀の刃” の通り名を持つ海賊だったが、とあるきっかけで海賊を廃業し義賊に転身した。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"89931"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/af9d9ea19f83fbb20811119b75eb60fec94ecb995840dee61eec0aa10d150b22.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/24/24a6e814218e2568c12e3b9928e734371fdd12441670e294e3f0e87512c8c4c2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"南月悠奈","creatorId":"vndb:s692","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s692","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s692","name":"水瀬 沙季","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:122992:89931:6349:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31949","characterName":"オリヴィア・スカーレット","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"89932","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"122992"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6058"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31949"},"originalCharacterName":"オリヴィア・スカーレット","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A captain who leads one of the three pirate factions whom are active in the waters near the kingdom. She is rumored to have the strongest force of the three pirate factions."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She earned the nickname \"Olivia, the female barbarian\" because she is a female leader and she hates weak men as she leads a pirate group consisting of mostly females."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Originally from a well-known family who fell to ruin. Perhaps because of this, she has a dignity that does not impair her while she is in the rough pirate business."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31949"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"王国近海で活動する三海賊のひとつを束ねる船長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"三海賊最強と謳われる高い武力を持ち、勝ち気な性格の姉御肌。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女性上位主義者で軟弱な男を嫌悪しており、ほぼ女性船員のみの海賊団を率いていることから『蛮娼のオリヴィア』の通り名を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元は没落した名家の出身で粗暴な海賊稼業に身を置きながらも損なわない品格を湛えている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6058","sourceWorkId":"21532","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"王国近海で活動する三海賊の一つを束ねる船長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"三海賊最強と謳われる高い武力を持ち、勝ち気な性格の姉御肌。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女性上位主義者で軟弱な男を嫌悪しており、ほぼ女性船員のみの海賊団を率いていることから “蛮娼のオリヴィア” の通り名を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元は没落した名家の出身。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのためか、粗暴な海賊稼業に身を置きながらも損なわない品格を湛えている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"89932"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b18200347e1b734c5f3ba93f766089dc9ab