e":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The captain of a large pirate crew who was known as the Pirate King 300 years ago and was said to be the strongest and most ruthless pirate in the world. He has a very cruel personality and is a hardened hedonist. He was betrayed by one of his subordinates, the man who went on to became the first king of the Kingdom of Austria. He is killed in a deceitful manner, but his spirit lives on with the grudge. By chance, he gains a new body and is revived in the pressent time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c49389"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"300年前、『海賊王』の異名を持ち最強最悪と言われた大海賊の船長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は非常に残虐で快楽主義者。部下の一人、アウストリア王国の初代国王となった男に裏切られて、無残な形で殺されるが、怨念となって生きながらえ、何の因果か新たな肉体を得て現世に復活を遂げる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6061","sourceWorkId":"21532","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"300年前に “海賊王” の異名で恐れられ、最強最悪とまで言われた大海賊の船長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は非常に残虐で快楽主義者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最期はアウストリア王国の初代国王となった男に裏切られ、無残な形で殺される。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが死してもなお怨念となって生きながらえ、新たな肉体を得て現世に復活を遂げた。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"89936"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d1/d1f17c307bf61df8e3d2f6b16a8307edb0c08a57179b0f23570ec5c0e845d050.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2e1bfad540fceded42dad2ec47250aced9d1520b413a4ce7a85ced600b7f3153.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c49390","characterName":"ゴドウィン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"89938","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"122992"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6065"],"v